    },
    {
      "issue": "Generate standing tracking and standing reaction/reset poses; current sheet ends with kneeling variants.",
      "resolution": "New directional standing raise/shoot/lower/reset frames replace the previous kneeling track/reset cells. Tracking is angle-correct at all eight headings."
    },
    {
      "issue": "Review eight-view turnaround gear handedness, final alpha and directional transitions against original reference.",
      "resolution": "Runtime eight-way compact atlases were inspected against the original turnaround on a solid backing. True alpha, consistent ground pivots and distinct unmirrored directional views are recorded in qa/atlas-validation.json. The original turnaround remains only an angle-correct emergency fallback."
    }
  ],
  "knownLimitations": [
    "Compact keyframe animation: 1 idle/ready pose, 3-4 walk drawings, 3 raise/lower poses, and 2 crouch/kneel poses; these are not full hand-animated production cycles.",
    "Back, rear-right and right use one reviewed standing-shoot pose because an alternate generated source cell clipped the shoes.",
    "Generated art has small clothing, hand and camera-detail variations between views; final in-game desktop/mobile art approval is still needed.",
    "Six rejected source cells are never sampled at runtime; they remain transparent in the packed atlas and are documented in qa/atlas-validation.json."
  ]
